{"4031820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Havok Balloons Tech Showcase", "steam_appid": 4031820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havok usually works behind the scenes helping to power your favourite AAA games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year we marked the 25th anniversary of Havok Physics. And we celebrated the usual way… by creating a new tech showcase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Havok Physics for Unreal we were able to make a great-looking level that showcases the power of Havok Physics running in the Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This showcase proved so popular at our industry meetings that we decided it should have a wider audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the balloon-filled physics playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional developers can find out more on our website including details on all Havok products and how to start an evaluation. We have a range of flexible pricing plans for professional projects of different sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Havok usually works behind the scenes helping to power your favourite AAA games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year we marked the 25th anniversary of Havok Physics. And we celebrated the usual way… by creating a new tech showcase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Havok Physics for Unreal we were able to make a great-looking level that showcases the power of Havok Physics running in the Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This showcase proved so popular at our industry meetings that we decided it should have a wider audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the balloon-filled physics playground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional developers can find out more on our website including details on all Havok products and how to start an evaluation. We have a range of flexible pricing plans for professional projects of different sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Havok usually works behind the scenes helping to power your favourite AAA games, but this tech showcase proved too popular to keep to industry only meetings.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031820/b1a7722241cfdc17a9ee54aa501f3810b7da43c4/header.jpg?t=1765789341", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031820/1b514a3ad95768318bc467d540447590de3762ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765789341", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031820/1b514a3ad95768318bc467d540447590de3762ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765789341", "website": "https://www.havok.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-7920X CPU @ 2.90GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This is a technical demo where performance is highly dependent on rendering. Although it was not tested on hardware with lower spec, it is likely to run without issues on slightly older machines.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></l